      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹11.13 (up from ₹8.62 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.49b (up 14% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹43.0m (up 29% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.7% (up from 1.5% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 9% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
